<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH C.BANK SETS 13-WK BILL AUCTION, 12.4 PCT MAX.</title>
<headline>CZECH C.BANK SETS 13-WK BILL AUCTION, 12.4 PCT MAX.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Wednesday set a Dutch auction offering five billion crowns in its 13-week liquidity bills for Thursday, with maximum gross yield on bids at 12.4 percent.</p>
<p>Gross yield in the last auction offering three billion crowns in similar bills on February 12 was also 12.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
